<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Zupbar || get a trip</title>
</head>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/insidegettrip.css" />
<style data-styled="" data-styled-version="4.3.2"></style>

<body>

  <div class="bodyDiv">
    <div id="mainDiv">
      <div class="subdiv" style="overflow-y: scroll">
        <h3 class="section_heading">&rArr; Agenda</h3>
        <div class="activityCard">
          <div class="cardContainer">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card_detail">
                <div class="card_content">
                  <div class="card_header">
                    <div class="cardLine"></div>
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardheading" style="font-size: 3vh">India tours and travels</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardSubHeading">
                        India tours and travels
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="card_body">
                    <div class="card_description">
                      <div class="cardLine">Board the bus from Bangalore</div>
                      <div class="cardLine">
                        Please ensure you reach boarding point 30 mins before
                        to avoid any rush
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="section_heading">&rArr; Bus Details</h3>
        <div class="activityCard">
          <div class="cardContainer">
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card_detail">
                <div class="card_content">
                  <div class="card_header">
                    <div class="cardLine"></div>
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardheading">&#11043; Non-AC</span>
                    </div>
                    <br />
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardheading">&#11043; Semi-Sleeper</span>
                    </div>
                    <br />
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardheading">&#11043; Ultra-luxury</span>
                    </div>
                    <br />
                    <div class="cardLine">
                      <span class="cardheading">&#11043; Vlovo 9600</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cancellationContainer ">
          <h3 class="section_heading">&rArr; Cancellation Policies</h3>
          <br />
          <table>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="header_cancellation">
                <th class="time_cancellation_text">Time of Cancellation</th>
                <th class="percentage_deduction_cancellation">
                  Deduction Percentage
                </th>
                <th class="percentage_cancellation_charges">
                  Cancellation Charges
                </th>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="durationTd">Before 25th Nov 07:30 AM</td>
                <td class="deduction_percentage">15%</td>
                <td>₹105</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="durationTd">
                  From 25th Nov 07:30 AM Until 26th Nov 07:30 AM
                </td>
                <td class="deduction_percentage">30%</td>
                <td>₹210</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="durationTd">
                  From 26th Nov 07:30 AM Until 26th Nov 09:30 PM
                </td>
                <td class="deduction_percentage">50%</td>
                <td>₹350</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="durationTd">
                  From 26th Nov 09:30 PM Until 27th Nov 07:30 AM
                </td>
                <td class="deduction_percentage">100%</td>
                <td>₹700</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="tncDescription ">
          <h3 class="section_heading">&rArr; Terms and Conditions</h3>
          <br>
          <br>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            1. Transportation provided is only available according to the
            itinerary provided
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            2. Anything not mentioned in the package and the itinerary will
            not be provided
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            3. Package rates are subjected to change without prior notice
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            4. Refund in case of cancellations depends on the Operator's
            Cancellation Policy
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            5. IBIBO group reserves the right to change/modify or terminate
            the offer any time at its own discretion and without any prior
            notice
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            6. Food Charges are not included in the package rates, should be
            paid by Passengers
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            7. Guide Charges and Entry Fees are not included in the package
            rates, should be paid by Passengers
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            8. If required, all passengers shall produce the Identity Proof
            compulsory for the Darshan, any of the ID proof like, Voter ID /
            Passport / Driving License, Aadhaar Card
          </div>
          <div class="termsCondition">
            9. All passengers should get full COVID-19 Vaccination Dose
            Certificate (2 Doses) as prescribed by the Government of India or
            COVID-19 Negative Certificate obtained within 72 hours prior to
            the date of darshan should be produced
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="subdiv">
        <div class="summary">
          <div class="summary_body fixed_summary" id="fixed_summary_cont" style="position: fixed; width: 29%">
            <div class="package_name">Kolkata to Mysore Tour</div>
            <div class="generic_section">
              <div class="journey_date">
                <span class="date_label">travel date</span>
                <span class="date">27 Nov</span>
              </div>
              <div class="includes">
                <div class="pkg_incl_label">Package Inclusions</div>
                <ul class="pkg_includes">
                  <li class="benefits">
                    <span class="text">Sightseeing</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="benefits">
                    <span class="text">Travel</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="benefits">
                    <span class="text">Travel</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="benefits">
                    <span class="text">Travel</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="benefits">
                    <span class="text">Travel</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="select_seat">
              <div class="select_label">Book your seats</div>
              <div class="bus_travels">
                <span>India tours and travels</span>
                <span>Non-AC Semi-Sleeper</span>
              </div>
              <button class="book_seat_btn">Book Seats</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>